1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,240
You have to be the remover of the force by letting flow happen.

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,020
Letting flow happen requires you even knowing you.

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:13,840
It's taken me so long to do so much self-work and self-exploration about what are the things that I allow to be force in my way.

4
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:19,280
Whether it's my codependency or abandonment issues or, you know, insecurities.

5
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:27,240
Like, what are the things that I am allowing to be in the way of me feeling good about my gut?

6
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,160
See, that's the thing.

7
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:32,060
It's not just to say, what am I allowing to get in the way of me getting to where I want to go?

8
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:32,920
That's not what I'm saying.

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,320
What am I allowing to get in the way of me trusting my gut?

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:42,440
Because when you know you have these things floating around, it makes you say, like, I don't know how much I can really listen to me.

11
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,100
Because you know you have these things.

12
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,760
Those things are force.

13
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:49,960
The jealousy, the codependency, the projecting, all of these things.

